WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.192
Now we fit a logistic regression classifier.

00:00:03.192 --> 00:00:07.637
The training features and training labels are passed to model dot fit.

00:00:07.637 --> 00:00:12.082
That is the stage where the model learns patterns from the training data.

00:00:12.082 --> 00:00:18.196
After fitting, predict is used on the first five test rows to produce class predictions.

00:00:18.909 --> 00:00:22.086
At this point, seeing predictions is not enough.

00:00:22.086 --> 00:00:27.911
We still need to compare them with the true test labels to know whether the model is performing well.
